  "hatarakiSkillAbout": "{id, select, woodcutting{Gathers logs. Carpentry turns them into planks and boxes.} fishing{Gathers fish to cook.} mining{Gathers ore and sometimes gems for smithing and jewelcrafting.} farming{Plants seeds and harvests rice, vegetables, cotton and tea leaves.} foraging{Picks mushrooms, flowers and wild fruit, and sometimes seeds.} agility{Only gives experience: each level makes everyone 0.1 % faster.} cooking{Makes food to feed your Tamas and for expeditions.} carpentry{Makes planks and bags to take on trips.} smithing{Smelts bars and forges tools for expeditions.} tailoring{Weaves cloth and clothes for expeditions.} tea{Brews teas that speed up work for 30 minutes (45 with a teapot).} jewelry{Cuts gems and makes charms for expeditions.} expedition{Goes up by sending Tamas on trips.} pottery{Fires clay with firewood: bowls, flasks for brewing, tiles and bricks for building, teapots and vases. The kiln leaves soot.} dyeing{Makes dyes from flowers and crops, and dyes cloth and clothes. Dyed clothes give more power in places of their colour.} construction{Makes beams, walls, roofs and the other pieces the village is built with.} writing{Makes paper and ink, and with them books to study and maps for trips.} brewing{Mixes herbs and spring water in flasks: potions for trips.} magic{Carves runes from gems, moon dust and clouds: they enchant the gear for one trip.} study{Only gives experience, by reading books: each level gives 0.1% more experience in everything.} other{?}}",
